      <data key="d3">compare</data>
      <data key="d4">To better understand the potential effects of instruction fine-tuning on how language models use long input contexts, we compare the multi-document question answering performance of MPT-30B-Instruct against its base model (i.e., before instruction fine-tuning) MPT- 30B</data>
    </edge>
