    <edge source="JSON" target="key-value retrieval" id="0">
      <data key="d3">be</data>
      <data key="d4">3.1 Experimental Setup In our synthetic key-value retrieval task, the inputs are (i) a string-serialized JSON object with k key- value pairs, where each of the keys and values are unique, randomly-generated UUIDs and (ii) a key within the aforementioned JSON object</data>
